erit;font-size:12px\">正在学习前端和 Vibe Coding，希望把想法快速做成原型。</textarea>\n          <div style=\"text-align:right;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:4px\">26 / 100</div>\n        </div>","<div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:8px\"><div style=\"max-width:82%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:12px 12px 2px 12px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5\">帮我把这段文案改得更口语化，保留原意，别超过 100 字</div></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px\"><img src=\"/assets/avatar-robot.png\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:2px 12px 12px 12px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.5\">好的，这是更口语化的版本……</div></div>\n          <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:8px 10px;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n            <textarea class=\"demo-input\" rows=\"1\" style=\"width:100%;border:0;padding:2px 4px;resize:none;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px;box-shadow:none\" placeholder=\"继续提问，Shift + Enter 换行\"></textarea>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:2px\"><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">📎 附件</span><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding:5px 14px\">发送</button></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>","<div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);width:56px;flex-shrink:0;padding-top:5px\">问题类型</span><span style=\"display:flex;gap:6px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">功能异常</span><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">体验建议</span><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">其他</span></span></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);width:56px;