mit feedback</button></div>\n        </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<textarea class=\"demo-input ta-demo\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Please enter...\"></textarea>","when":"General multi-line input such as comments and feedback"},{"demo":"<div class=\"ta-wrap\"><textarea class=\"demo-input ta-demo\" rows=\"2\">The interaction design of this component is very detailed and worth learning. </textarea><span class=\"ta-count\">21 / 500</span></div>","when":"When there is a character limit, show a live count"},{"demo":"<textarea class=\"demo-input ta-demo\" rows=\"2\" readonly>Content that cannot be changed after submission</textarea>","when":"When the content is final and should be shown without editing."},{"demo":"<textarea class=\"demo-input ta-demo\" rows=\"2\" disabled placeholder=\"Not editable yet\"></textarea>","when":"The entire text field is temporarily uneditable"}]},"usageMocks":{"ta-comment":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-textarea\">这段说明清楚，便于理解。</span><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">发布</span></div></div>","in-textarea":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-textarea\">这个组件的交互设计得很细致……<i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:65%\"></i></span></div>","ta-prompt":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-textarea\">帮我把这段文案改得更口语化，保留原意……<i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></span><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"justify-content:space-between\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">AI</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">生成</span></div></div>","ta-count":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-textarea\">这个组件的交互设计得很细致……</span><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">48 / 500</span></div></div>","in-exact":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">标题</span><span class=\"mk-input \">2026 年产品规划 v3</span></div></div>","in-select":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">状态</span><span class=\"mk-select\">进行中<i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span></div></div>","ta-richtext":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-textarea\">我想把这段话加粗，再插一张图……</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">纯文本框不支持富文本编辑</span></div>","ta-wall":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-textarea\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:95%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">一大段只读内容放进灰框，看起来像没填完的表单</span></div>"}}}